            <ArticleTitle>Entonox in the emergency department.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>311-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use Entonox (BOC Medishield) was examined in a large accident and emergency department and was found to give satisfactory relief from pain in 92 per cent of cases. This compares favourably with reports of its results in other applications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
